+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use argon2id as the password hashing algorithm, selected for its memory-hard design, which provides superior resistance to GPU- and ASIC-accelerated brute-force attacks compared to earlier approaches, reflecting a security posture aimed at the modern threat landscape.
